---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Accessibility | Quiet Grid Press">
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="shell legal-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A Clear and Respectful Website</p>
      <h1>Accessibility</h1>
      <p class="effective">Effective July 28, 2026</p>

      <p>
        Quiet Grid Press wants this website to be comfortable to read,
        understand, and navigate. The site is being built with semantic
        structure, keyboard access, visible focus states, readable contrast,
        responsive layouts, and alternative text for meaningful images.
      </p>

      <h2>Ongoing Work</h2>
      <p>
        Accessibility is an ongoing responsibility. We will test the site as it
        grows and correct barriers we can identify.
      </p>

      <h2>Book-Specific Claims</h2>
      <p>
        Website accessibility does not mean every Quiet Grid Press book is a
        large-print or accessible edition. Those descriptions are used only
        when a particular book has been intentionally designed and verified for
        that purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter difficulty using this website, please contact Quiet
        Grid Press using the postal information on the
        <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>. An electronic feedback method
        will be added when the official Quiet Grid Press email address is
        established.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
